sent 1.0s for “laughter” (4.5s): Far off on the plain the four men throw their heads back and laugh; the sound carries to her across the dust.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,900
sent 6.9s for “overheard” (10.4s): The woman in the doorway lifts her hand from the stone and raises it to shade her eyes, watching them come.

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:14,900
sent 10.9s for “darkness” (14.1s): The sun sinks behind the mesas and the sky turns deep copper; long shadows race across the plain toward the house.

4
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:19,700
sent 14.9s for “empty” (17.9s): Behind her the dark room is still: empty wooden chairs, a cold clay jebena coffee pot on the floor.

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:24,300
sent 19.7s for “burning” (23.2s): Out on the plain each man lifts a small glass hourglass whose sand glows like burning embers in the dusk.

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:29,700
